WEBVTT

01:38.560 --> 01:41.880
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:47.160 --> 01:48.720
Xindu is shadowed by death.

01:50.440 --> 01:52.360
Fourteen years ago,

01:52.440 --> 01:55.200
tens of thousands were buried here.

01:58.560 --> 01:59.840
No need to discuss this further.

02:00.800 --> 02:02.000
If Yanzhou

02:02.440 --> 02:03.800
has no sincerity…

02:06.800 --> 02:08.440
then you may leave

02:10.240 --> 02:12.040
and take the bride back with you.

02:38.520 --> 02:40.040
But this marriage

02:40.840 --> 02:42.960
is my grandmother's wish.

02:43.040 --> 02:43.880
So,

02:45.240 --> 02:47.320
if you want it to happen,

02:48.160 --> 02:49.840
the wedding must be held in Panyi.

02:51.160 --> 02:52.440
- Tan.
- Yes.

02:52.520 --> 02:54.640
Give the gift I prepared

02:54.720 --> 02:55.800
to Miss Xiaoqiao.

02:55.880 --> 02:56.760
Yes.

03:12.600 --> 03:15.120
PANYI ANNALS, YANZHOU

03:18.080 --> 03:19.080
My lady,

03:19.560 --> 03:21.080
if you ask me,

03:21.160 --> 03:23.480
the Lord of Wei does like you.

03:24.320 --> 03:26.480
Why don't you follow their arrangement,

03:26.560 --> 03:27.720
hand over the seal of Panyi…

03:27.800 --> 03:28.640
CULTURE INTRODUCTION

03:28.720 --> 03:30.240
…and marry him soon?

03:32.200 --> 03:34.760
This gift doesn't mean he likes me.

03:35.440 --> 03:36.760
It's a threat.

03:36.840 --> 03:37.720
PANYI

03:37.800 --> 03:39.480
He's long had his eye on Panyi.

03:39.560 --> 03:41.360
Even if I don't give it to him,

03:41.440 --> 03:43.560
he'll take it through war.

03:43.920 --> 03:44.920
Exactly.

03:45.680 --> 03:47.800
So,

03:47.880 --> 03:49.200
handing it over

03:49.280 --> 03:50.240
doesn't really matter.

03:50.720 --> 03:53.120
The dignified Lord of Wei

03:53.200 --> 03:55.360
wouldn't go back on his word, right?

03:56.840 --> 03:58.640
The feud between us

04:00.440 --> 04:02.720
was caused by a broken promise, right?

04:09.880 --> 04:12.200
To find a way out of this game,

04:12.280 --> 04:13.840
we must find his weakness

04:14.760 --> 04:16.920
and figure out what he truly wants.

04:17.000 --> 04:21.320
YUYANG COURTYARD, WEI STATE

04:29.920 --> 04:32.320
What kind of person is Wei Shao?

04:33.800 --> 04:34.600
He is

04:34.680 --> 04:36.240
narrow-minded

04:36.320 --> 04:37.480
and ruthless.

04:37.920 --> 04:39.920
Let me tell you, this is not like home.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.080
CHUNNIANG, XIAOQIAO'S WET NURSE

04:41.160 --> 04:42.840
You must speak and act with caution.

04:42.920 --> 04:44.240
Don't worry, Mother.

04:48.120 --> 04:49.480
Watch where you're going.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.160
Can't you see we're carrying things?

04:52.000 --> 04:53.560
What's that smell on him?

04:54.280 --> 04:55.160
It's not from me,

04:55.240 --> 04:56.520
it's from the chest.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.560
Inside is Li Su.

04:58.240 --> 04:59.600
Nonsense.

04:59.680 --> 05:01.280
Li Su is tall and strong.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.440
How could he fit in a chest?

05:03.120 --> 05:04.960
Even Li Su didn't believe it at first.

05:06.360 --> 05:08.680
Not until he saw his own hands and feet

05:08.760 --> 05:09.960
cut off

05:10.040 --> 05:12.600
and placed inside piece by piece.

05:12.920 --> 05:13.760
Then he believed it.

05:14.320 --> 05:15.040
Look.

05:22.120 --> 05:22.960
Generals,

05:23.040 --> 05:24.720
we're new here and don't know the rules.

05:24.800 --> 05:25.880
Please forgive us.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.200
Forgive us.

05:27.280 --> 05:28.400
Let me tell you,

05:28.480 --> 05:30.880
His Lordship is not someone
who's easy to deal with.

05:30.960 --> 05:33.360
If you don't want to end up like Li Su,
learn the rules.

05:34.640 --> 05:36.440
This chubby little girl even threw up.

05:41.160 --> 05:44.640
Li Su killed three generations
of their family

05:44.720 --> 05:46.400
and slaughtered Xindu City.

05:46.840 --> 05:48.600
What happened to him

05:48.680 --> 05:49.920
is no surprise.

05:50.440 --> 05:52.480
To know how broad-minded he is,

05:52.560 --> 05:54.080
you must see how he treats the people.

05:54.760 --> 05:56.640
He treats them poorly too.

05:56.720 --> 05:58.160
I heard people say…

05:58.720 --> 06:01.120
His Lordship has given orders
that from today onward,

06:01.200 --> 06:04.520
everything like this is forbidden here.

06:04.600 --> 06:06.280
Anyone who disobeys
will be punished severely.

06:07.160 --> 06:09.200
Even praying for blessings is not allowed?

06:11.320 --> 06:12.640
How does he treat those close to him?

06:12.720 --> 06:13.960
He's suspicious of them.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.840
They say the Lord of Wei
kills in his sleep.

06:17.320 --> 06:19.720
He never lets anyone near him
while he sleeps.

06:20.240 --> 06:21.080
I think

06:21.160 --> 06:22.720
he's just afraid of being assassinated.

06:42.880 --> 06:43.600
Who's there?

06:45.080 --> 06:45.840
Wei Xiao.

06:45.920 --> 06:48.120
My lord, the candle inside has gone out.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.320
Shall we add more oil?

06:51.760 --> 06:52.680
No need.

07:02.280 --> 07:03.160
Come here.

07:03.240 --> 07:04.320
Come here.

07:05.720 --> 07:07.120
Are you stupid?

07:08.600 --> 07:11.560
His sleeping with the lights on is not
something he wants others to know.

07:12.920 --> 07:14.240
The advisor said

07:14.320 --> 07:15.880
we should act like we know nothing.

07:18.440 --> 07:19.640
It must be hard on His Lordship.

07:20.200 --> 07:21.920
He was locked in that tiny wooden box.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.440
If it were me,

07:23.520 --> 07:26.200
I'd be afraid not just of the dark
but of the wood itself.

07:29.680 --> 07:31.680
Say something, okay?

07:32.480 --> 07:33.880
I can't even beat a word out of you.

07:33.960 --> 07:36.760
Maybe if we speak louder,
His Lordship won't be scared anymore.

07:40.360 --> 07:42.360
It's like I'm talking to a wall.

07:49.000 --> 07:49.920
My lord.

07:50.520 --> 07:51.400
My lord.

07:54.320 --> 07:55.320
My lord.

08:04.200 --> 08:05.080
- My lord.
- My lord.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.840
GRAIN

08:15.800 --> 08:17.760
You haven't finished counting
the households?

08:19.800 --> 08:20.760
Leave.

08:23.120 --> 08:23.960
My lord,

08:24.360 --> 08:27.480
the people of Xindu
suffered under Li Su for years.

08:27.560 --> 08:29.240
They're still watching and waiting.

08:30.040 --> 08:32.000
We'll need more patience.

08:42.039 --> 08:43.559
- Where is this place?
- Is that Her Ladyship?

08:43.640 --> 08:45.920
- The people say this place is Tan Terrace.
- Yes.

08:46.000 --> 08:47.920
You can see all of Xindu from the top.

08:48.640 --> 08:49.520
What a pity

08:49.600 --> 08:51.000
it's now in ruins.

08:52.280 --> 08:53.400
Let's go up and take a look.

08:53.920 --> 08:56.120
My lady, the terrace
has long fallen into disrepair.

08:56.200 --> 08:57.800
Be careful climbing up.

08:57.880 --> 08:59.200
You can't call her that yet.

08:59.280 --> 09:01.800
Our lady hasn't married
the Lord of Wei yet.

09:01.880 --> 09:03.440
Then when will you marry?

09:03.520 --> 09:05.240
Please marry soon.

09:05.320 --> 09:07.600
Yes. If there's a wedding,
the Lord of Wei won't slaughter the city.

09:07.680 --> 09:09.280
These days, he's counting households

09:09.360 --> 09:12.400
so he can kill off all the migrants
from the border regions.

09:12.480 --> 09:13.640
- That's right.
- Yes, miss.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.200
Please save us.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.400
The roadblocks are enough,

09:43.480 --> 09:45.080
but if the arrow towers
were a little taller,

09:45.160 --> 09:46.600
the view would be better.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.160
Look.

09:49.240 --> 09:51.040
There's a woman in red up there.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.160
That's Lady Qiao, right?

09:53.680 --> 09:55.200
Yes, that's her.

09:55.760 --> 09:58.120
Just like the rumors say,
she's beautiful as a flower.

09:58.840 --> 10:01.120
Do you think
the Lord of Wei will like her?

10:01.200 --> 10:02.680
When will they get married?

10:03.360 --> 10:06.280
If they wed,
there won't be any more war here.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.000
Showing off.

10:18.640 --> 10:20.080
She's just pretty.

10:35.160 --> 10:35.880
My lady.

10:36.600 --> 10:39.200
Xindu is truly in ruins.

10:40.000 --> 10:43.800
So you'll marry the Lord of Wei in Panyi
just like he wants?

10:45.840 --> 10:47.520
We'll marry here in Xindu.

10:48.640 --> 10:50.920
I think I've found a way out.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.600
- Sir, give me a little money.
- Get lost.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.560
Are you all right?

10:57.640 --> 10:58.800
Thank you, miss.

10:58.880 --> 10:59.920
Thank you, miss.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.560
There's a deep pothole on East Street.

11:04.640 --> 11:06.680
Our lady's carriage can't get through.

11:06.760 --> 11:09.000
Is there anyone kind enough
to help clear the road?

11:09.080 --> 11:10.800
Each helper will receive
five pecks of flour.

11:10.880 --> 11:11.600
I'm willing to go.

11:11.680 --> 11:12.640
We're all willing.

11:12.720 --> 11:14.360
We're willing to go. We all want to help.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.880
My lord,

11:15.960 --> 11:17.280
the people have gone
to repair the streets.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.160
Why?

11:18.240 --> 11:20.080
They say Lady Qiao paid them generously.

11:24.040 --> 11:25.000
My lord,

11:25.080 --> 11:26.960
the people have gone to repair the well.

11:27.760 --> 11:28.720
Really?

11:31.520 --> 11:32.960
Why would they dig a well for no reason?

11:33.040 --> 11:33.920
Come on.

11:34.000 --> 11:35.440
Everyone, eat up.

11:35.520 --> 11:38.680
To thank everyone for fixing the roads,

11:38.760 --> 11:41.040
Miss Xiaoqiao has had a meal
prepared for you.

11:41.120 --> 11:42.240
She's so kind.

11:42.320 --> 11:44.600
- She's used to drinking well water.
- She gave us food and money.

11:44.680 --> 11:47.240
But the wells in the city
have been dry for days.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.880
It's all right. Don't worry.

11:48.960 --> 11:49.800
We'll fix it together.

11:49.880 --> 11:51.320
- Shall we?
- Yes.

11:51.400 --> 11:53.040
Will we be paid for digging the well?

11:53.120 --> 11:54.000
- Of course.
- Eat up.

11:54.080 --> 11:57.200
We wouldn't dare trouble you for nothing,
would we?

11:57.280 --> 11:58.200
That's wonderful.

12:00.000 --> 12:02.000
I heard Lady Qiao also loves flowers.

12:02.080 --> 12:03.480
Many people picked wildflowers
to give her.

12:03.560 --> 12:04.240
GRAIN

12:04.320 --> 12:05.840
Lady Qiao is truly something.

12:05.920 --> 12:07.400
Shortly after she came,

12:07.480 --> 12:09.640
Tan Terrace was restored,
and the roads were cleared.

12:09.720 --> 12:12.200
Even the roadside weeds and wildflowers
have been mostly cleaned out.

12:16.880 --> 12:18.680
YUYANG COURTYARD

12:18.760 --> 12:20.800
CHANGQING

12:27.160 --> 12:30.040
- I hope Miss Xiaoqiao likes them.
- Thank you so much.

12:30.120 --> 12:32.040
- I hope Miss Xiaoqiao likes them.
- Thank you.

12:32.520 --> 12:34.440
- I hope Miss Xiaoqiao likes them.
- Thank you very much.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.160
- I hope Miss Xiaoqiao likes them.
- Thank you.

12:36.240 --> 12:38.800
This is way too much.
Stop them from sending more.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.800
Flowers are of no practical use.

13:31.880 --> 13:34.960
People like them because they long
for what they represent.

13:37.880 --> 13:39.880
Are you trying to say

13:39.960 --> 13:41.680
that the people love you

13:41.760 --> 13:43.160
because they long for you too?

13:44.760 --> 13:46.080
I didn't mean that.

13:47.520 --> 13:49.680
The people treat me kindly

13:49.760 --> 13:51.400
because they long for you,

13:52.880 --> 13:54.640
waiting to see what you want.

13:56.360 --> 13:58.200
Everyone knows

13:58.280 --> 13:59.880
I'm a Qiao from Yanzhou.

14:00.760 --> 14:02.680
Compared to the people from the border,

14:02.760 --> 14:05.480
I'm the one you despise most.

14:06.600 --> 14:09.680
If you can set aside past grudges
and marry me,

14:09.760 --> 14:12.560
it means you're magnanimous.

14:12.640 --> 14:16.640
Then the people will no longer fear you
and will follow you.

14:20.360 --> 14:22.000
You're good with words,

14:22.880 --> 14:25.120
twisting things around
just to get me to marry you.

14:27.000 --> 14:28.680
This is the will of the people.

14:30.120 --> 14:32.520
So why not go with the people's will

14:32.600 --> 14:34.760
and hand over the seal of Panyi to me

14:34.840 --> 14:36.280
so we can get married soon?

14:43.960 --> 14:46.560
Xindu has always been part of Wei.

14:46.640 --> 14:48.320
I share the people's will and purpose.

14:49.360 --> 14:51.480
Li Su was the first to sow discord,

14:52.240 --> 14:54.280
and now you play mind games.

14:55.360 --> 14:56.720
You both disgust me.

15:01.760 --> 15:04.160
Don't think for a second that
I'm as easy to fool as my grandfather.

15:11.480 --> 15:12.760
As for the seal,

15:14.200 --> 15:15.880
I suggest you make your decision soon.

15:17.000 --> 15:18.240
I have some patience,

15:19.000 --> 15:20.440
but

15:20.520 --> 15:21.600
not much.

15:30.600 --> 15:32.280
The Lord of Wei

15:32.360 --> 15:34.120
really is cold as stone.

15:36.120 --> 15:40.040
If he was easily persuaded,
it wouldn't be trustworthy.

15:40.120 --> 15:42.680
So what do we do now?

15:45.880 --> 15:48.040
My heart is like water,

15:48.120 --> 15:49.920
and water wears down stone.

15:52.480 --> 15:55.600
Turns out Lady Qiao is pretty tough.

15:56.240 --> 15:58.920
His Lordship fought day and night
just to reclaim Xindu.

15:59.000 --> 16:01.120
Those flowers should be offered to him.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.640
His Lordship doesn't care for flowers.

16:03.720 --> 16:05.880
Otherwise, he'd be like a weak woman.

16:06.480 --> 16:07.400
Right.

16:07.480 --> 16:09.560
Lady Qiao has managed to do
what His Lordship failed to do.

16:09.640 --> 16:11.000
That's what's bothering him.

16:12.480 --> 16:13.520
Good for you.

16:13.600 --> 16:16.080
You're usually like a mute,
but now you've hit the nail on the head.

16:17.200 --> 16:18.280
Hey, give it to me.

16:18.360 --> 16:19.920
- Whoa.
- Catch it.

16:32.080 --> 16:33.040
My lord, please spare us!

16:33.120 --> 16:35.120
We didn't see you there and offended you.

16:35.680 --> 16:37.160
Are those flowers meant for Lady Qiao?

16:40.040 --> 16:40.960
They are for you, my lord.

16:41.040 --> 16:43.120
You're a renowned, brave fighter.

16:43.200 --> 16:44.120
I…

16:44.200 --> 16:47.760
I heard you'll be the new Lord of Xindu,

16:47.840 --> 16:50.080
and Lady Qiao is to be your wife,

16:50.160 --> 16:51.400
so I passed them to her.

16:51.920 --> 16:53.680
Fine, hand them here.

16:53.760 --> 16:55.040
I'll hold them for His Lordship.

16:55.120 --> 16:57.880
From now on,
don't bring useless things like this.

16:57.960 --> 16:58.960
- Go now.
- Yes.

16:59.040 --> 17:01.040
Thank you, my lord.

17:01.600 --> 17:03.720
Who says His Lordship doesn't have
the people's support?

17:03.800 --> 17:06.200
Seems to me the commoners know
who their lord is.

17:06.280 --> 17:08.920
Then why won't they come and register
to collect their food?

17:10.440 --> 17:12.160
Give them more time.

17:12.240 --> 17:14.119
Thick ice doesn't freeze in a day.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.839
I've got some patience left.

17:16.920 --> 17:17.880
Let's go.

17:20.760 --> 17:21.720
Mayor!

17:21.800 --> 17:22.800
Help us!

17:22.880 --> 17:24.839
Wei Shao's killing people
in the streets on horseback.

17:24.920 --> 17:26.480
They've been counting households every day

17:26.560 --> 17:28.440
just so they can kill
all of us border folk.

17:28.520 --> 17:31.240
They're trying to steal our food.

17:31.320 --> 17:33.960
Even good families can't protect
their daughters anymore.

17:34.040 --> 17:34.880
ZHEN MANSION

17:34.960 --> 17:37.680
Yeah, they treat lives like weeds.

17:37.760 --> 17:39.640
Xindu has changed hands.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.720
I'm no longer your mayor.

17:50.840 --> 17:53.000
Though you have reclaimed lost land,

17:54.080 --> 17:56.080
the people of Xindu today

17:56.160 --> 17:58.680
are no longer subjects of Wei.

17:59.960 --> 18:02.440
You wish to win them over quickly,

18:02.520 --> 18:04.680
but they've been poisoned by Li Su's lies.

18:04.760 --> 18:07.480
They may not understand
your intentions at once.

18:08.320 --> 18:09.600
Besides,

18:10.440 --> 18:12.160
you didn't take Xindu

18:12.240 --> 18:14.360
just to get revenge.

18:15.400 --> 18:17.920
You have greater ambitions

18:19.480 --> 18:21.880
and will need the people's help.

18:26.280 --> 18:27.160
My lord,

18:28.000 --> 18:30.600
governing people is like managing water.

18:32.040 --> 18:33.280
You can't rush it.

18:35.840 --> 18:38.080
Then let's see
who runs out of patience first

18:39.200 --> 18:40.840
between me and her.

18:44.840 --> 18:47.200
PEOPLE'S WALL, WEI STATE

18:47.280 --> 18:49.000
Back then, after the battle of Xindu,

18:49.080 --> 18:52.760
countless families
lost their sons and husbands.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.840
After Li Su entered the city,

18:54.920 --> 18:57.080
he forbade the people
from collecting the bodies

18:57.160 --> 18:58.920
and burying their loved ones.

18:59.000 --> 19:01.120
So whenever the people
could leave the city,

19:01.200 --> 19:03.200
they would sneak out
to the eastern battlefield

19:03.280 --> 19:06.200
to find their relatives' belongings,
hide them in their clothes,

19:06.280 --> 19:07.600
and smuggle them back in.

19:08.760 --> 19:10.000
This wall

19:10.480 --> 19:13.080
was built from those keepsakes.

19:14.080 --> 19:15.000
But

19:15.560 --> 19:17.040
as the years passed,

19:17.840 --> 19:22.400
people gradually turned this place
into a shrine for prayers,

19:22.480 --> 19:24.600
forgetting its true meaning.

19:24.680 --> 19:25.600
NANNY ZHONG
LADY XU'S MAID

19:26.320 --> 19:28.720
To the people, this wall is a place

19:28.800 --> 19:31.160
to grieve over their loved ones.

19:32.120 --> 19:33.720
To His Lordship,

19:35.160 --> 19:37.240
it's a memorial to the dead.

19:37.640 --> 19:39.440
I came to Xindu this time

19:39.520 --> 19:42.720
to ensure the marriage
between you and His Lordship

19:43.680 --> 19:45.480
so that Lady Xu can be at peace.

19:45.880 --> 19:47.920
This is a wishing plate.

19:48.000 --> 19:50.400
May your marriage go smoothly.

19:52.520 --> 19:53.280
Thank you.

19:53.360 --> 19:55.120
STAY UNITED AS ONE
DO NOT PART IN ANGER

20:04.880 --> 20:06.320
STAY IN GOOD HEALTH
GROW OLD TOGETHER

20:11.800 --> 20:12.520
Where's Wei Duo?

20:12.600 --> 20:14.400
Didn't I order this to be cleared?
Why is it still here?

20:14.480 --> 20:15.480
My lord,

20:15.560 --> 20:17.640
the people have kept up this habit
for over a decade.

20:18.160 --> 20:20.160
It's understandable
they can't change overnight.

20:43.080 --> 20:44.280
What are you doing here?

20:52.320 --> 20:53.280
My lord.

20:54.440 --> 20:56.000
I'm praying for the people.

20:56.080 --> 20:57.200
Praying?

21:00.320 --> 21:01.640
Do you know what this place is…

21:07.720 --> 21:08.720
and why this wall

21:09.560 --> 21:11.000
was built?

21:16.960 --> 21:19.320
How could you let her pray here?

21:25.320 --> 21:26.920
How many of you still remember

21:27.800 --> 21:29.320
why this wall exists…

21:31.840 --> 21:33.640
and who should be held responsible for it?

21:34.960 --> 21:35.840
Come on.

21:37.080 --> 21:38.520
Take all this down and burn it.

21:39.080 --> 21:40.120
Burn it all.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.120
- My lord, please don't!
- You can't burn it.

21:42.200 --> 21:44.760
My lord, you can't burn it.

21:54.760 --> 21:55.920
You're ruthless!

21:56.000 --> 21:59.360
You're not fit to rule Xindu.
You don't deserve it!

22:07.680 --> 22:10.760
My lord, Zhen Zhi used to
work for the late lord.

22:10.840 --> 22:12.520
When Xindu fell,

22:12.600 --> 22:15.120
he surrendered to Li Su
to protect the people.

22:15.640 --> 22:17.280
My lord, please calm your anger.

22:18.000 --> 22:20.080
My lord, please spare the mayor.

22:20.160 --> 22:24.080
Please spare the mayor!

22:24.160 --> 22:27.320
My lord, please spare the mayor.

22:28.160 --> 22:30.440
He's a good man.

22:34.680 --> 22:36.600
His Lordship watched with his own eyes

22:36.680 --> 22:40.560
as his father, brothers, and people
were slaughtered.

22:40.640 --> 22:42.720
How can he let that go so easily?

22:43.720 --> 22:49.000
That's exactly why Lady Xu wants to forge
a marriage alliance with Yanzhou.

22:50.200 --> 22:54.440
Lady Xu feels sorry for His Lordship.

22:54.520 --> 22:57.320
She hopes he can move on

22:57.400 --> 22:59.560
and live with less pain.

22:59.640 --> 23:01.640
My lady, what are you thinking?

23:03.480 --> 23:05.560
I think I know what he needs.

23:08.720 --> 23:10.480
Li Su was a thief,

23:11.000 --> 23:12.360
and you, Wei Shao,

23:12.920 --> 23:14.400
are no better.

23:15.240 --> 23:18.280
Back then, Li Su's army
pillaged the city for grain.

23:18.360 --> 23:19.840
Now, you take control of Xindu

23:19.920 --> 23:23.640
and force the people
to offer food, wine, and women.

23:25.560 --> 23:27.120
How are you any different from Li Su?

23:27.200 --> 23:29.120
Yes, you're just like him.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.320
Exactly the same.

23:30.400 --> 23:32.200
The late lord was a righteous man.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.920
You are…

23:35.320 --> 23:37.120
unworthy to be his heir.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.200
My life is nothing,

23:41.680 --> 23:42.680
but what a pity.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.720
What a pity that Xindu

23:45.640 --> 23:47.800
has fallen into a bandit's hands.

23:48.200 --> 23:49.040
My lord,

23:49.120 --> 23:50.360
kill this man now.

23:50.440 --> 23:51.880
We can't let him confuse the public.

23:51.960 --> 23:52.960
Yes, my lord.

23:53.040 --> 23:53.840
Yes. Let's kill him.

23:53.920 --> 23:55.440
- Kill him.
- We can't let him live.

23:55.520 --> 23:56.720
My lord,

23:56.800 --> 23:58.160
if you kill Zhen Zhi,

23:58.240 --> 23:59.840
everything we've worked for
will be ruined.

24:00.720 --> 24:02.240
Please punish him severely.

24:02.320 --> 24:04.080
We fought so hard for Xindu.

24:04.160 --> 24:06.560
Was it for these people
to insult even our ancestors?

24:09.240 --> 24:10.600
My lady, must you go?

24:10.680 --> 24:12.400
This could put you in danger.

24:13.000 --> 24:15.200
My lord, you must execute him.

24:16.680 --> 24:19.200
- Kill him, my lord.
- Just say the word.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.560
I have something to say to His Lordship.

24:25.680 --> 24:26.840
Just in time.

24:29.240 --> 24:30.200
Let her in.

24:37.640 --> 24:39.160
This started because of you.

24:39.760 --> 24:40.960
Aren't you going to say anything?

24:41.560 --> 24:43.520
I just did a divination.

24:43.600 --> 24:45.840
The auspicious wedding date
is in three days.

24:45.920 --> 24:47.800
If we miss it,
we'll have to wait a long time.

24:49.280 --> 24:51.400
You keep delaying the marriage

24:51.480 --> 24:55.240
because you just took control of Xindu
and have been busy rebuilding it.

24:56.000 --> 25:01.160
But now, the people don't obey you
or listen to your orders.

25:01.240 --> 25:04.240
Will you have your soldiers

25:04.320 --> 25:06.320
spend their days making bricks and mortar?

25:09.200 --> 25:12.160
I have a plan to ease your troubles.

25:13.160 --> 25:15.560
Most of Xindu's people

25:15.640 --> 25:18.480
are migrants from the borderlands.

25:19.000 --> 25:21.280
Since they refuse to submit,

25:21.680 --> 25:23.040
why not…

25:24.680 --> 25:25.960
make an example of them?

25:26.960 --> 25:28.920
Kill one to warn the rest.

25:29.000 --> 25:31.120
If one's not enough, kill ten.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.680
If ten's not enough, kill a hundred.

25:32.760 --> 25:33.840
Keep killing until they obey.

25:33.920 --> 25:34.840
You…

25:34.920 --> 25:36.240
You venomous woman.

25:36.320 --> 25:40.000
With this, we can marry sooner.

25:40.080 --> 25:42.200
As expected of that jerk's granddaughter.

25:42.280 --> 25:43.600
You wicked thing.

25:47.160 --> 25:49.360
Last night he tried to kill His Lordship,

25:49.440 --> 25:51.400
and now he dares insult me.

25:51.480 --> 25:52.920
We can't let him live.

25:53.600 --> 25:54.800
We don't have to slaughter the city,

25:54.880 --> 25:57.680
but at least his entire clan should be
executed to eliminate future threats.

25:57.760 --> 25:59.080
How vicious!

26:17.200 --> 26:18.800
- My lady!
- My lord…

26:21.560 --> 26:23.280
If I follow your advice,

26:24.040 --> 26:25.760
how would I be any different from Li Su?

26:26.840 --> 26:28.640
Your grandfather's betrayal
brought me to ruin.

26:29.320 --> 26:31.440
And now you try to sway me

26:31.520 --> 26:33.880
into slaughtering a city for your sake?

26:35.080 --> 26:36.800
You viper.

26:36.880 --> 26:38.400
That's right. She's a viper.

26:38.480 --> 26:40.840
- Kill her.
- That viper. Kill her.

26:40.920 --> 26:41.920
My lord.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.600
- Kill her.
- Kill her!

26:43.680 --> 26:44.760
Please calm yourself.

26:44.840 --> 26:47.240
Kill her!

26:47.840 --> 26:49.120
Please calm yourself.

26:53.760 --> 26:54.960
I was ignorant.

26:56.240 --> 26:57.440
Please forgive me.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.440
I will never forgive you.

27:04.320 --> 27:06.280
- Bad woman!
- You're so vicious!

27:06.360 --> 27:08.400
You're so cruel.

27:08.480 --> 27:10.320
You will not meet a good end.

27:10.400 --> 27:12.960
You won't meet a good end.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.240
This started because of Lady Qiao.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.760
I will never fall for her schemes

27:18.520 --> 27:20.200
to turn me against the people of Xindu.

27:25.640 --> 27:26.920
As for the mayor…

27:43.800 --> 27:45.400
You only pleaded for the people.

27:45.960 --> 27:46.920
You're blameless.

27:51.600 --> 27:52.640
Please rise.

28:09.800 --> 28:11.000
My lord,

28:11.960 --> 28:13.920
you're just like the late lord.

28:15.760 --> 28:20.240
After 14 years of Xindu
existing under the enemy's rule,

28:21.720 --> 28:23.520
at last, we are back.

28:28.200 --> 28:31.160
His Lordship is righteous
and cares for his people.

28:31.240 --> 28:35.480
His Lordship is righteous
and cares for his people!

28:44.960 --> 28:46.040
Thank you, my lord.

28:47.920 --> 28:49.760
Thank you, my lord. Thank you.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.120
- Thank you.
- Thanks.

28:55.480 --> 28:57.360
Luckily, His Lordship is sensible.

28:57.440 --> 29:00.440
Otherwise, the whole city
would've suffered for her.

29:00.520 --> 29:01.680
So what if she's pretty?

29:01.760 --> 29:03.240
- Get lost.
- That viper!

29:03.320 --> 29:05.280
- She's so cruel.
- Indeed.

29:05.360 --> 29:06.480
What's going on?

29:06.840 --> 29:08.200
My lord, you may not know.

29:08.280 --> 29:09.880
The people surrounded Yuyang Courtyard.

29:09.960 --> 29:12.680
Lady Qiao couldn't go back,
so she had to hide on the Tan Terrace.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.360
She's not so pretty.

29:19.440 --> 29:20.560
It's just rumors.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.080
I think she's just average.

29:22.160 --> 29:23.720
Actually, she's kind of ugly.

29:23.800 --> 29:25.560
Can you tell from here?

29:25.640 --> 29:26.760
Why say she's ugly?

29:27.640 --> 29:30.000
My lord, you mustn't marry this woman.

29:30.080 --> 29:31.760
Send her away from Xindu now.

29:33.560 --> 29:34.640
You may leave.

29:35.000 --> 29:37.080
His Lordship will decide.

29:37.840 --> 29:39.320
- Yes.
- Let's go.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.840
- Let's go now.
- Let's go.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.080
Let's go back.

29:57.360 --> 30:00.480
You are so different from earlier.

30:07.160 --> 30:10.160
I know you put on that act to help me out.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.400
But what I hate most

30:12.480 --> 30:14.000
is how your clan

30:14.960 --> 30:16.160
manipulates people at every turn,

30:16.240 --> 30:17.200
always scheming,

30:17.720 --> 30:20.720
thinking you can control everyone.

30:21.800 --> 30:23.960
Yet you don't know
that heaven follows rules

30:24.040 --> 30:24.960
but people don't.

30:30.200 --> 30:31.240
Still,

30:32.280 --> 30:34.320
you're a bit better than your grandfather.

30:35.280 --> 30:38.280
At least you paid a price for the show.

30:47.480 --> 30:49.200
Apply this on your neck.

30:49.280 --> 30:50.160
HEALING POWDER

30:54.240 --> 30:55.200
My lord.

30:57.560 --> 31:00.280
I haven't congratulated you
on gaining the people's trust.

31:00.360 --> 31:02.440
Nanny Zhong got this for me.

31:02.800 --> 31:04.080
You should have it.

31:44.040 --> 31:45.760
STAY UNITED AS ONE
DO NOT PART IN ANGER

31:54.480 --> 31:55.360
What does this mean?

31:56.840 --> 31:59.320
You're too young to get it.

31:59.400 --> 32:03.280
It's about a couple
staying united forever.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.960
What does it actually mean?

32:08.800 --> 32:10.080
Say something.

32:13.040 --> 32:15.840
STAY UNITED AS ONE
DO NOT PART IN ANGER

32:21.680 --> 32:22.640
Next.

32:22.720 --> 32:23.880
- Take it.
- Thanks.

32:23.960 --> 32:24.840
Thank you. Thank you.

32:27.600 --> 32:31.280
GRAIN

32:31.680 --> 32:33.200
My lord, thank you for the food.

32:34.680 --> 32:35.720
Thank you, my lord.

32:37.440 --> 32:38.320
They'll all get some.

32:45.600 --> 32:46.800
OUT FOR TODAY

32:46.880 --> 32:48.760
That's all for today.
Come back tomorrow.

32:48.840 --> 32:50.120
Out again?

32:50.200 --> 32:51.080
It's out again?

32:51.160 --> 32:52.600
- Don't push.
- I didn't get it yesterday.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.640
- Don't push.
- I still didn't get it today.

32:54.720 --> 32:56.120
Please give me some.

32:56.200 --> 32:57.400
There's no food left at home.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.480
Don't push.

32:59.680 --> 33:00.680
Step back. Don't push.

33:00.760 --> 33:01.440
What's going on?

33:01.520 --> 33:02.680
The food ran out again today.

33:02.760 --> 33:04.000
- Don't push.
- It's out?

33:04.080 --> 33:05.280
There are too many people.

33:05.680 --> 33:06.800
My lord.

33:07.320 --> 33:08.280
My lord, please help us.

33:08.360 --> 33:10.320
Everyone, everyone.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.480
Please listen.

33:12.040 --> 33:13.680
To prevent panic,

33:13.760 --> 33:16.400
we distribute a certain amount of food
regularly every day.

33:16.480 --> 33:18.800
If it's not enough,
we'll increase the supply.

33:18.880 --> 33:20.280
Lies. Just give us food.

33:20.360 --> 33:21.800
Give us food.

33:21.880 --> 33:23.320
You will get it.

33:23.400 --> 33:24.480
Please be patient.

33:26.160 --> 33:27.520
I promise you,

33:28.000 --> 33:29.280
no one will go hungry.

33:30.120 --> 33:31.720
For today, please return home.

33:32.760 --> 33:34.200
All right. We trust you.

33:34.280 --> 33:36.280
- Come back tomorrow.
- Fine. We trust the Lord of Wei.

33:36.360 --> 33:37.840
- Thanks, my lord.
- Thanks.

33:37.920 --> 33:39.000
My lord,

33:39.080 --> 33:40.960
we got the people's trust too soon.

33:41.040 --> 33:42.680
They all came rushing for food.

33:42.760 --> 33:45.000
Once we counted, we realized

33:45.080 --> 33:47.920
there were far more refugees
than expected.

33:49.200 --> 33:52.360
Are you saying the grain we brought
from Wei isn't enough?

33:54.240 --> 33:55.680
This year's drought

33:55.760 --> 33:58.000
has left all of Wei short on food.

33:58.080 --> 33:59.680
The disaster relief grain we brought

33:59.760 --> 34:02.840
was scraped together
by cutting rations across every region.

34:02.920 --> 34:06.480
It'll be hard to get more.

34:06.560 --> 34:07.880
But I already promised

34:07.960 --> 34:10.080
that every household in Xindu
would have food.

34:11.400 --> 34:12.360
My lord,

34:13.800 --> 34:15.560
there's a city

34:17.080 --> 34:18.520
within reach.

34:21.719 --> 34:25.080
PANYI ANNALS

34:33.840 --> 34:34.800
Wei Liang.

34:37.280 --> 34:38.199
Pull.

34:38.280 --> 34:39.800
One, two, three.

34:45.480 --> 34:49.639
I heard the Lord of Wei gave
all the army's provisions to the people.

34:49.719 --> 34:54.920
Maybe he's not as ruthless or vengeful
as we thought.

34:55.639 --> 34:57.080
Even so,

34:57.720 --> 34:59.920
if I give up Panyi,

35:00.000 --> 35:02.160
I'll have nothing left to rely on.

35:02.920 --> 35:05.360
My lady, the Lord of Wei has torn down
the People's Wall.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.080
That wall was built

35:09.160 --> 35:11.440
with the lives of the people of Wei.

35:13.720 --> 35:14.680
But now,

35:16.680 --> 35:18.240
it's become a symbol of hatred.

35:19.040 --> 35:20.640
Instead of letting it keep you in fear,

35:21.400 --> 35:22.880
I'd rather take it down.

35:24.160 --> 35:26.240
I've suffered the pain
of losing loved ones,

35:26.960 --> 35:28.920
so I won't let you suffer it again.

35:31.080 --> 35:32.640
So starting today,

35:33.760 --> 35:36.080
the grudges from 14 years ago

35:36.160 --> 35:37.480
are erased.

35:39.160 --> 35:40.720
Whether you're from Yanzhou,

35:41.360 --> 35:42.480
Bianzhou,

35:42.560 --> 35:43.720
or Liangya,

35:45.160 --> 35:46.200
from now on,

35:47.120 --> 35:48.760
you are people of Xindu.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.360
That's wonderful.

35:50.440 --> 35:51.480
We finally have a home.

35:51.560 --> 35:52.920
The Lord of Wei is so righteous.

35:56.000 --> 35:56.920
Lord Zhen,

35:57.480 --> 35:58.760
you risked your life

35:58.840 --> 36:00.160
to speak up for the people.

36:00.240 --> 36:01.680
It's admirable.

36:02.880 --> 36:04.200
So from now on,

36:04.840 --> 36:07.440
Xindu will return to being
under your governance.

36:13.120 --> 36:13.960
Wei Qu.

36:25.680 --> 36:26.560
As you wish,

36:27.840 --> 36:28.760
my lord.

36:30.640 --> 36:31.760
Thank you, my lord.

36:37.840 --> 36:39.080
Starting today,

36:40.040 --> 36:41.520
the soldiers of Wei

36:41.600 --> 36:43.720
will work side by side
with the people of Xindu

36:43.800 --> 36:45.000
to rebuild this city,

36:46.120 --> 36:47.760
so you can once again

36:48.520 --> 36:49.640
live and work in peace.

36:49.720 --> 36:53.440
Live and work in peace!

36:53.520 --> 36:57.520
Live and work in peace!

36:57.600 --> 37:04.600
Live and work in peace!

37:05.080 --> 37:07.120
Live and work in peace!

37:53.320 --> 37:55.240
Give out the food.

37:58.280 --> 38:00.520
Give out the food!

38:00.600 --> 38:02.000
OUT FOR TODAY

38:02.080 --> 38:03.400
Give out the food!

38:10.320 --> 38:12.840
This can't be delayed any longer.

38:12.920 --> 38:16.280
My lord, please marry
Miss Xiaoqiao at once.

38:16.360 --> 38:18.160
My lord, Miss Xiaoqiao is here.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.120
Perfect timing.

38:21.200 --> 38:24.640
My advisor and I were just discussing
the marriage.

38:29.160 --> 38:30.040
My lord.

38:30.840 --> 38:33.600
Miss Xiaoqiao, is there
something urgent you need?

38:34.320 --> 38:37.760
On my way back from the post house,
I saw people still had no food.

38:38.440 --> 38:40.160
But Panyi has food.

38:40.240 --> 38:41.880
It could ease your urgent need.

39:05.080 --> 39:06.680
You love the people like your children.

39:06.760 --> 39:07.840
I'm sure that one day,

39:07.920 --> 39:10.520
you'll treat the people of Panyi
as your own.

39:11.920 --> 39:14.240
I'm willing to offer my entire fortune.

39:14.920 --> 39:16.600
I only hope you'll accept me

39:17.640 --> 39:20.360
and forge an alliance for the people.

39:22.680 --> 39:24.400
We're not even married yet.

39:25.600 --> 39:26.920
Why do you trust me so?

39:28.600 --> 39:29.920
Because you're kind.

39:35.040 --> 39:36.200
Kind?

39:41.840 --> 39:43.320
You think I'm gullible, don't you?

39:55.720 --> 39:57.520
Your clan is far too naïve.

40:00.240 --> 40:01.880
Do you think a betrothal

40:02.520 --> 40:04.480
can wipe out 14 years of hatred?

40:11.440 --> 40:13.960
Did you truly believe your beauty alone

40:14.040 --> 40:15.520
could enchant me?

40:24.920 --> 40:28.760
That crafty rat Qiao Gui
played his cards well,

40:28.840 --> 40:32.040
sending a granddaughter here
to act all gentle and sweet

40:32.120 --> 40:34.280
just to trick me
into allying with Yanzhou.

40:36.360 --> 40:38.360
Was this how he fooled my grandfather
back then?

40:42.520 --> 40:43.760
Let me tell you this.

40:48.560 --> 40:50.360
We won't fall for

40:51.760 --> 40:53.200
your clan's tricks twice.
